				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;sect1&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;_about_me&#34;&gt;About me&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;sectionbody&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;paragraph&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I am a compiler dev (?) who is interested in bespoke architectures such as target-triggered architectures, dataflow, transputers, etc.&#xA;These days I’m dabbling in a little bit of program analysis and PL Theory (HM type system, etc.).&#xA;Have a look around and talk to me if you find something interesting on here.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
